@PaveLGIL 
> Is it possible to add possibility to use dynamic selectors in PVC.

It is not possible, you can either use static provisioning with a specific PV name or a selector or dynamic provisioning with storage class.

@PaveLGIL hope it helped you, 
if there is an actual bug please log a new issue and fill the template.

