By the way, all my request paths are nginx(10.4.83.27:8081)-->nodePort(nginx-service)-->pods
```
# nginx config
    upstream backend {
        server 10.4.87.33:33632;
        server 10.4.87.34:33632;
        server 10.4.87.35:33632;
        keepalive 300;
    }

    server {
        listen 8081;
        server_name ljohn.com;

        location / {
            proxy_pass http://backend;
            proxy_http_version 1.1;
            proxy_set_header Connection "";
        }
    }
# Concurrency testing
time seq 1 2000 | parallel -j5 curl -s "http://10.4.83.27:8081/" >> /tmp/3000.txt
# cat /tmp/3000.txt | grep 'http-deployment-1' | wc -l
75
